wn to the bunker to plan your next comp match together.\n\nHANG OUT\n- Up to 20 players in a room, with voice chat that stays in the room you're in\n- Join the public basement or make your own server: public, or private with a 4-digit join code for your group only\n- Two card tables with a full deck, chips, an UNO-style deck and a dealer screen with 25 games and their rules\n- A bar with four beer taps, real pouring, bottles and shots\n- Darts with a 301 scoreboard, foam dart blasters and a boombox with radio stations\n- A tube TV with a retro console, four controllers and parody racing, pod racing and shooter games\n- A movie projector with public-domain and open films\n\nPLAN YOUR MATCHES\n- A code-locked strategy bunker with armoured doors and 20 seats, with its own voice chat away from the party upstairs\n- Map layouts on the projector screen, a laser pointer and a neon pen to draw routes and calls\n- A chalkboard that keeps your plans saved for next time, and a host who controls the door code\n\nComfort: snap or smooth turning, comfort options, block and report tools.\n\nMature content: depicts cannabis and alcohol use, crude humour, cartoon violence and gore.\n\nRadio music by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com), licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0).", "short_description": "A 90s basement for your group to hang out in, and a code-locked bunker where competitive teams plan strategy for their matches. Up to 20 players: cards, beer, darts, a retro console and plenty to pass around."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/passthedutchie", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tired Wizard Productions LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/passthedutchie", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [